            "reviewBody": "There's this amazing salsa verde type guacamole we get from a local meat market and I have been searching for a year for a similar recipe. I feel like I've finally found a recipe just like it. This is so good, I feel like boiling the tomatillos really makes a huge difference compared to similar recipes I've tried. This has great flavor and perfect texture. I made exactly as written but to please my hubby I added a cut up avocado after it was done as he prefers a chunky style. This will definitely be in my regular rotation. My whole family loved this.",
